    "detailed_description": "HARD VOID is a 4X turn-based strategy game, in a space setting inspired by Lovecraft mythos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design your ships! </h2>Highly customizable spaceship designs allow the selection of multiple ship systems: laser cannons, nuclear missiles, fusion reactors and much more :<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/b5aae8a23e2bc09e412ad2b46e1b1033.poster.avif?t=1753690185\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/b5aae8a23e2bc09e412ad2b46e1b1033.webm?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/b5aae8a23e2bc09e412ad2b46e1b1033.mp4?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3b4bb1def93a513c5cecc22f332e819d.poster.avif?t=1753690185\" width=434 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3b4bb1def93a513c5cecc22f332e819d.webm?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3b4bb1def93a513c5cecc22f332e819d.mp4?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each spaceship is unique and procedurally generated by your requirements.</h2>The procedural spaceship generator can produce up to 18 Trillion unique spaceships hulls! <br>No two spaceship designs will look the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3a1561038a1e241c27e4de87846c5c7d.poster.avif?t=1753690185\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3a1561038a1e241c27e4de87846c5c7d.webm?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/3a1561038a1e241c27e4de87846c5c7d.mp4?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the galaxy!</h2>Turn based strategic combat, command hundred of spaceships to battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/1c53ccd27664c11c5957229e993508f7.poster.avif?t=1753690185\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/1c53ccd27664c11c5957229e993508f7.webm?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/1c53ccd27664c11c5957229e993508f7.mp4?t=1753690185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize the galaxy and multiple dimensions!</h2>Use multiple FTL travel methods to explore expand : Warp, Sub, Wormholes and more.<br>Colonize planets, asteroids and the space itself, also you can explore multiple dimensions, but beware,  <br>you aren't only dealing with just other species, space travel unlocks horrors beyond comprehension that are waiting in the vast dark void and will trial your empire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/45978db2aff318dc0cc9210aa1bd3a4e.poster.avif?t=1753690185\" width=434 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/45978db2aff318dc0cc9210aa1bd3a4e.webm?t=1753690185\" 